      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Production rule\nPoker server does NOT dual-write Kafka.\nDebezium publishes only committed DB changes.\nBinary payload stays behind a versioned adapter.\n\nCurrent project substitute:\nPokerKit → canonical Kafka topics",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Production rule\nPoker server does NOT dual-write Kafka.\nDebezium publishes only committed DB changes.\nBinary payload stays behind a versioned adapter.\n\nCurrent project substitute:\nPokerKit → canonical Kafka topics",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
