      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "SPCS SERVICE — POKER_FLINK\nDocker: poker-flink:<git-sha>\nJava 17 + Flink 1.19\n\nJob A: event-time context enrichment\n• as-of temporal join • watermarks • corrections\nJob B: pair feature computation\n• keyed state / TTL / dedup • prior-only history\n• six players → 15 canonical pairs\nDurable checkpoints + savepoint upgrades",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SPCS SERVICE — POKER_FLINK\nDocker: poker-flink:<git-sha>\nJava 17 + Flink 1.19\n\nJob A: event-time context enrichment\n• as-of temporal join • watermarks • corrections\nJob B: pair feature computation\n• keyed state / TTL / dedup • prior-only history\n• six players → 15 canonical pairs\nDurable checkpoints + savepoint upgrades",
