      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "SPCS SERVICE — POKER_RISK\nDocker: poker-risk:<git-sha>\nGo risk-kafka + scorer\n\n• assemble exactly 15 pairs per hand\n• validate model / feature / policy versions\n• CatBoost ONNX batch inference\n• Platt calibration + alert threshold\n• hand risk = max calibrated pair score\n• publish acknowledged outputs, then commit\n• deterministic IDs; correction-aware replay",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SPCS SERVICE — POKER_RISK\nDocker: poker-risk:<git-sha>\nGo risk-kafka + scorer\n\n• assemble exactly 15 pairs per hand\n• validate model / feature / policy versions\n• CatBoost ONNX batch inference\n• Platt calibration + alert threshold\n• hand risk = max calibrated pair score\n• publish acknowledged outputs, then commit\n• deterministic IDs; correction-aware replay",
