      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "SNOWFLAKE TRAINING DATASETS\nPoint-in-time features + delayed labels\nLeakage-safe chronological splits:\n• train — fit model / preprocessing\n• validation — calibration + threshold\n• test — one final public evaluation\n• private challenge — sealed until gate\nManifests • hashes • event alignment",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SNOWFLAKE TRAINING DATASETS\nPoint-in-time features + delayed labels\nLeakage-safe chronological splits:\n• train — fit model / preprocessing\n• validation — calibration + threshold\n• test — one final public evaluation\n• private challenge — sealed until gate\nManifests • hashes • event alignment",
