      "fontSize": 18.063525933987396,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "CURRENT PRODUCTION CHAMPION\nPair-level CatBoost classifier\nInputs: behavioral + action + outcome +\nuser/account/device/network/session context\nServing: CPU ONNX, one 15-pair batch / hand\nPost-model: Platt calibration + frozen threshold\nPolicy: maximum pair probability → player/hand risk\nRules remain evidence / baseline, not final model",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CURRENT PRODUCTION CHAMPION\nPair-level CatBoost classifier\nInputs: behavioral + action + outcome +\nuser/account/device/network/session context\nServing: CPU ONNX, one 15-pair batch / hand\nPost-model: Platt calibration + frozen threshold\nPolicy: maximum pair probability → player/hand risk\nRules remain evidence / baseline, not final model",
