      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "PRODUCTION GUARANTEES\nAt-least-once transport + deterministic IDs + idempotent sinks  •  commit offsets only after durable output  •  canonical contracts isolate PostgreSQL binary and CDC schemas\nNo Snowflake or PostgreSQL query per hand in the hot path  •  Flink state is checkpointed, not the system of record  •  DGX never serves production realtime traffic\nGo owns adapters / scoring / APIs  •  Java is isolated to Flink  •  Python owns ML / data / monitoring / admin  •  Rust is a future measured replacement, not an initial dependency\nBlue = company source   Amber = Confluent managed   Purple = SPCS containers   Cyan = Snowflake managed data   Green = ML lifecycle   Dashed = optional/control",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PRODUCTION GUARANTEES\nAt-least-once transport + deterministic IDs + idempotent sinks  •  commit offsets only after durable output  •  canonical contracts isolate PostgreSQL binary and CDC schemas\nNo Snowflake or PostgreSQL query per hand in the hot path  •  Flink state is checkpointed, not the system of record  •  DGX never serves production realtime traffic\nGo owns adapters / scoring / APIs  •  Java is isolated to Flink  •  Python owns ML / data / monitoring / admin  •  Rust is a future measured replacement, not an initial dependency\nBlue = company source   Amber = Confluent managed   Purple = SPCS containers   Cyan = Snowflake managed data   Green = ML lifecycle   Dashed = optional/control",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
